Project Overview

A mobile music streaming app designed to provide an engaging and user-friendly experience for music discovery, personalized playlists, and playback.

Design Process
Initial sketches and wireframes
User interface design in Figma
Light and dark theme variations
Interactive prototype creation
Final screen design and review
Design Features
Music discovery and search
Personalized playlists and recommendations
Music playback controls
Library and artist pages
User profile and listening statistics
Settings and appearance preferences
Design System

The interface uses pink, purple, and deep violet tones, balanced with neutral backgrounds and colorful artwork. Separate light and dark themes provide visual variety.

